  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.26: styling hooks for applying one theme across outputs. AvaloniaRenderTheme gains BodyFont, BodyForeground, HeadingFont, HeadingForegrounds with FallbackHeadingForeground and HeadingForeground(level), and TableHeaderForeground (all null by default: the host style applies), honoured by the full, paged and incremental Avalonia renderers. New EpubRenderOptions.CustomCss appends CSS to the EPUB stylesheet. New TrueTypeFontInfo.ReadFamilyName returns a font file's family name for CSS and Avalonia font references. See CHANGELOG.md.",
